Description: Kavis taskbar and start menu
 Taskbar sitting at the bottom of the screen: start button with the K
 logo on the left, the open windows of the current virtual desktop in
 the middle, desktop indicator, keyboard language, battery and clock
 on the right.
 .
 The start menu holds a search box, a program list grouped by
 category and a power button at the bottom (lock, sleep, shut down,
 restart popup).
 .
 Written in Vala and compiled to a single native binary; per madde 3
 it replaced the Python version (a few MB of RAM instead of 117 MB).
 UI strings are taken from the docs/kavis-arayuz-metinleri.md tables.
